    "title": "04、错误处理和trap信号捕获",
    "uri": "/%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD/shell/shell%E7%BC%96%E7%A8%8B%E6%8A%80%E5%B7%A7/04.%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF%E5%A4%84%E7%90%86%E5%92%8Ctrap%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E6%8D%95%E8%8E%B7/index.html"
